1
00:00:00,018 --> 00:00:01,815
Welcome to ResGrid Academy.

2
00:00:01,983 --> 00:00:06,206
In this lesson, we will make location
information useful and current.

3
00:00:06,406 --> 00:00:10,611
A map can mislead when old positions
remain visible or useful sites

4
00:00:10,612 --> 00:00:12,288
and reference layers are missing.

5
00:00:12,455 --> 00:00:16,164
We will explain the features,
the setup decisions, and a

6
00:00:16,164 --> 00:00:18,271
practical way to check the result.

7
00:00:19,097 --> 00:00:23,330
A department adds its stations and
hospitals as points of interest and lets

8
00:00:23,344 --> 00:00:28,402
personnel locations expire after sixty
minutes, so old positions disappear.

9
00:00:28,559 --> 00:00:32,638
A current map shows where responders
and apparatus are and puts important

10
00:00:32,649 --> 00:00:34,954
locations in front of dispatchers.

11
00:00:35,175 --> 00:00:39,143
The examples in this series use a
fictional department and are teaching

12
00:00:39,144 --> 00:00:41,589
scenarios, not default settings.

13
00:00:42,421 --> 00:00:43,014
Mapping.

14
00:00:43,218 --> 00:00:46,191
The live map of personnel,
units, and calls.

15
00:00:46,444 --> 00:00:50,164
Set how long locations stay on
the map in the mapping settings.

16
00:00:50,382 --> 00:00:52,902
Availability also depends on mapping.

17
00:00:53,115 --> 00:00:55,350
Check access in the target department.

18
00:00:56,140 --> 00:00:57,229
Points of interest.

19
00:00:57,421 --> 00:01:01,330
Points of interest such as
stations, hospitals, and hydrants.

20
00:01:01,550 --> 00:01:04,202
Add the locations dispatchers need to see.

21
00:01:04,388 --> 00:01:06,907
Availability also depends on mapping.

22
00:01:07,125 --> 00:01:09,360
Check access in the target department.

23
00:01:10,152 --> 00:01:11,630
Weather zones and alerts.

24
00:01:11,834 --> 00:01:14,457
Weather alert zones and
alert notifications.

25
00:01:14,694 --> 00:01:17,418
Draw the zones you cover
and choose who is alerted.

26
00:01:18,223 --> 00:01:19,100
Map layers.

27
00:01:19,316 --> 00:01:21,762
Add your own shapes and
